1\u002Fdocs\u002FModelArk\u002F1544681\"\u003EModel service billing\u003C\u002Fa\u003E.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"741ab123\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n# Large language models\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\" data-tips-is-title=\"true\"\u003ENote\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003EThe peak and off\\-peak hours for \u003Ccode\u003Edeepseek-v4-1-flash-260910\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E are as follows:\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n   * \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003EPeak hours: (UTC+8) Monday to Friday, 09:00\\-12:00 and 14:00\\-18:00.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n   * \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003EOff\\-peak hours: All times other than the peak hours listed above are off\\-peak hours.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003EThe console displays the peak\\-hour price for \u003Ccode\u003Edeepseek-v4-1-flash-260910\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E. See the table below for complete pricing.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"aa1874cf\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n## Online inference (standard)\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"2,1,1,1,1,1,1,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Model ID** |**Pricing tiers**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(K tokens) |**Input**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(non\\-audio)** \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD\u002FM tokens) |**Input**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(audio)** \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD\u002FM tokens) |**Cache\\-storage**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD\u002FM tokens\u002FHour) |**Cache\\-hit input**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(non\\-audio)** \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD\u002FM tokens) |**Cache\\-hit input**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(audio)** \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD\u002FM tokens) |**Output**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD\u002FM tokens) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|dola\\-seed\\-2\\-1\\-turbo |Prompt length [0, 256] |0.5 |\\- |0.0083 |0.1 |\\- |2.5 |\n|seed\\-2\\-0\\-lite\\-260428 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.25 |3.75 |0.0083 |0.05 |0.75 |2.00 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.50 |7.50 |0.0083 |0.10 |1.50 |4.00 |\n|seed\\-2\\-0\\-mini\\-260428 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.10 |1.50 |0.0083 |0.02 |0.30 |0.40 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.20 |3.00 |0.0083 |0.04 |0.60 |0.80 |\n|seed\\-2\\-0\\-pro\\-260328 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.50 |\\- |0.0083 |0.10 |\\- |3.00 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |1.00 |\\- |0.0083 |0.20 |\\- |6.00 |\n|seed\\-2\\-0\\-lite\\-260228 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.25 |\\- |0.0083 |0.05 |\\- |2.00 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.50 |\\- |0.0083 |0.10 |\\- |4.00 |\n|seed\\-2\\-0\\-mini\\-260215 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.10 |\\- |0.0083 |0.02 |\\- |0.40 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.20 |\\- |0.0083 |0.04 |\\- |0.80 |\n|seed\\-2\\-0\\-code\\-preview\\-260328 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.50 |\\- |0.0083 |0.10 |\\- |3.00 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |1.00 |\\- |0.0083 |0.20 |\\- |6.00 |\n|seed\\-1\\-8\\-251228 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.25 |\\- |0.0083 |0.05 |\\- |2.00 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.50 |\\- |0.0083 |0.05 |\\- |4.00 |\n|glm\\-5\\-3\\-flash\\-260828 |\\- |0.15 |\\- |0.0083 |0.03 |\\- |0.5 |\n|glm\\-5\\-2\\-260617 |\\- |1.4 |\\- |0.0083 |0.26 |\\- |4.4 |\n|glm\\-4\\-7\\-251222 |\\- |0.6 |\\- |0.0083 |0.11 |\\- |2.2 |\n|deepseek\\-v4\\-1\\-flash\\-260910 |Off\\-peak hours |0.15 |\\- |0.0083 |0.003 |\\- |0.60 |\n||Peak hours |0.30 |\\- |0.0083 |0.006 |\\- |1.20 |\n|deepseek\\-v4\\-pro\\-ga\\-260813 |\\- |1.32 |\\- |0.0083 |0.044 |\\- |3.96 |\n|deepseek\\-v4\\-pro\\-260425 |\\- |1.32 |\\- |0.0083 |0.044 |\\- |3.96 |\n|deepseek\\-v4\\-flash\\-ga\\-260731 |\\- |0.44 |\\- |0.0083 |0.014 |\\- |1.32 |\n|deepseek\\-v4\\-flash\\-260425 |\\- |0.44 |\\- |0.0083 |0.014 |\\- |1.32 |\n|deepseek\\-v3\\-2\\-251201 |Prompt length [0, 32] |0.28 |\\- |0.0083 |0.056 |\\- |0.42 |\n||Prompt length (32, 128] |0.56 |\\- |0.0083 |0.056 |\\- |0.84 |\n|seed\\-1\\-6\\-250915 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.25 |\\- |0.0083 |0.05 |\\- |2.00 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.50 |\\- |0.0083 |0.05 |\\- |4.00 |\n|seed\\-1\\-6\\-flash\\-250715 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.075 |\\- |0.0083 |0.015 |\\- |0.30 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.10 |\\- |0.0083 |0.015 |\\- |0.80 |\n|gpt\\-oss\\-120b\\-250805 |\\- |0.10 |\\- |\\- |\\- |\\- |0.5 |\n\n\n\n\u003E * Pay\\-as\\-you\\-go by token. Calculation formula:\n\n\u003E    * `Online inference cost = Input unit price × Input tokens + Cached input unit price × Cache hit tokens + Cache storage unit price × Cache storage tokens × Duration + Output unit price × Output tokens`\n\n\u003E * Tiered billing: Applicable to some models. Token unit prices vary for different prompt lengths (and output lengths):\n\n\u003E    * Example: A request with 200k input tokens and 14k output tokens falls in the range of **prompt length (128, 256]** , so the model's input and output tokens are billed at: 0.25 USD per million tokens for input, 2 USD per million tokens for output.\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"flex\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n## Online inference (Flex)\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"2,1.5,1,1,1,1,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Model ID** |**Pricing tiers**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(K tokens) |**Input**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(non\\-audio)** \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD\u002FM tokens) |**Input**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(audio)** \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD\u002FM tokens) |**Cache\\-hit input**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(non\\-audio)** \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD\u002FM tokens) |**Cache\\-hit input**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(audio)** \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD\u002FM tokens) |**Output**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD\u002FM tokens) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|dola\\-seed\\-2\\-1\\-turbo |Prompt length [0, 256] |0.25 |\\- |0.10 |\\- |1.25 |\n|deepseek\\-v4\\-pro\\-ga\\-260813 |\\- |0.66 |\\- |0.044 |\\- |1.98 |\n|deepseek\\-v4\\-flash\\-ga\\-260731 |\\- |0.22 |\\- |0.014 |\\- |0.66 |\n\n\n\n\u003E * Input and output token prices for Online inference (Flex) are approximately 50% of the prices for online inference (standard). Cached input token prices are the same as those for online inference (standard).\n\n\u003E * Online inference (Flex) supports implicit caching only. No additional cache storage fee applies.\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"f9bc1208\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n## Batch inference\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"2,1,1,1,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Model ID** |**Pricing tiers**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(K tokens) |**Input**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD \u002F M tokens) |**Cache\\-hit input**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD \u002F M tokens) |**Output**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD \u002F M tokens) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|dola\\-seed\\-2\\-1\\-turbo |Prompt length [0, 256] |0.25 |0.10 |1.25 |\n|seed\\-2\\-0\\-pro\\-260328 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.25 |0.10 |1.50 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.50 |0.20 |3.00 |\n|seed\\-2\\-0\\-lite\\-260228 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.125 |0.05 |1.00 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.25 |0.10 |2.00 |\n|seed\\-2\\-0\\-mini\\-260215 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.05 |0.02 |0.20 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.10 |0.04 |0.40 |\n|seed\\-1\\-8\\-251228 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.125 |0.05 |1.00 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.25 |0.05 |2.00 |\n|seed\\-1\\-6\\-250915 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.125 |0.05 |1.00 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.25 |0.05 |2.00 |\n|seed\\-1\\-6\\-flash\\-250715 |Prompt length [0, 128] |0.0375 |0.015 |0.15 |\n||Prompt length (128, 256] |0.05 |0.015 |0.40 |\n|glm\\-4\\-7\\-251222 |\\- |0.3 |0.11 |1.1 |\n|deepseek\\-v4\\-pro\\-ga\\-260813 |\\- |0.66 |0.044 |1.98 |\n\n\n\n\u003E * Pay\\-as\\-you\\-go by token. Calculation formula: `Batch inference cost = Input unit price × Input tokens + Cache hit unit price × Cache hit tokens + Output unit price × Output tokens`\n\n\u003E * Some models support transparent prefix caching. For these models, no configuration is required, and you can enjoy lower unit prices after cache hits.\n\n\u003E * seed\\-1\\-6 series supports tiered pricing, that is, different token unit prices are adopted according to the input and output length of each request.\n\n\u003E    * Example: A request with 200k input tokens and 14k output tokens falls in the range of **prompt length (128, 256]** , so the model's input and output tokens are billed at: 0.25 USD per million tokens for input, 2 USD per million tokens for output.\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"8f25f772\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n# Video generation models\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\" data-tips-is-title=\"true\"\u003ELimited\\-time discount\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003ELimited\\-time discounts are now available for Seedance 2.0 mini and Seedance 2.0 fast. The discounts apply only to enterprise users. Billing returns to the list price after the specified token usage cap is reached. For detailed rules, see \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fai.byteplus.com\u002Fark\u002Fregion:ap-southeast-1\u002Fdocs\u002FModelArk\u002F2630943\"\u003ELimited\\-time discount campaign rules for Seedance models\u003C\u002Fa\u003E.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESeedance 2.0 mini\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E: From 14:00 (UTC+8) on August 7, 2026 through 14:00 (UTC+8) on October 7, 2026, both 480p and 720p output are billed at \u003Cstrong\u003E60% off the list price\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. For 720p output, the price starts at approximately USD 0.03 per second.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESeedance 2.0 fast\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E: From 14:00 (UTC+8) on August 7, 2026 through 14:00 (UTC+8) on October 7, 2026, both 480p and 720p output are billed at \u003Cstrong\u003E25% off the list price\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. For 720p output, the price starts at approximately USD 0.09 per second.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"tip\" data-tips-is-title=\"true\"\u003Etip\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"tip\"\u003EVideo pricing is determined by both the \u003Cstrong\u003Etoken rate\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003Etoken consumption\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. Under otherwise identical conditions:\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"tip\"\u003EA video generated at a higher resolution costs more than one generated at a lower resolution.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"tip\"\u003EA video generated with video input costs more than one generated without video input.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"tip\"\u003EYou can use the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fbytedance.larkoffice.com\u002Fshare\u002Fbase\u002Fform\u002FshrcnIHSU1yg0GtzCX4pyW3g3yb\"\u003ESeedance 2.0 Series Pricing Calculator\u003C\u002Fa\u003E and \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fbytedance.larkoffice.com\u002Fshare\u002Fbase\u002Fform\u002FshrcnIYBa28VajWRTpAPEwR4icf\"\u003ESeedance 2.5 Series Pricing Calculator\u003C\u002Fa\u003E to estimate the cost of each video. For typical pricing scenarios, see the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fai.byteplus.com\u002Fark\u002Fregion:ap-southeast-1\u002Fdocs\u002FModelArk\u002F1544106#0c3cd17c\"\u003Epricing examples\u003C\u002Fa\u003E below.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"28d5ad67\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n## Pricing\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"2,2,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Model ID** |**Online inference**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD \u002F M tokens) |**Offline inference**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD \u002F M tokens) |\n|---|---|---|\n|dreamina\\-seedance\\-2\\-5\\-260628\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Pricing varies based on output video resolution and whether the input includes video. |* For 480p and 720p outputs:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input without video: 10.70\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input with video: 6.40\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* For 1080p outputs:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input without video: 11.7\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input with video: 7.0 |Not supported yet |\n|dreamina\\-seedance\\-2\\-0\\-260128\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Pricing varies based on output video resolution and whether the input includes video. |* For 480p and 720p outputs:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input without video: 7.0\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input with video: 4.3\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* For 1080p outputs:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input without video: 7.7\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input with video: 4.7\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* For 4K outputs:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input without video: 4.0\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input with video: 2.4 |Not supported yet |\n|dreamina\\-seedance\\-2\\-0\\-fast\\-260128\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Pricing varies based on whether the input includes video. |* For 480p and 720p outputs:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input without video: (Original) 5.6 `Time limited 25% off`\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input with video: (Original) 3.3 `Time limited 25% off` |Not supported yet |\n|dreamina\\-seedance\\-2\\-0\\-mini\\-260615\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Pricing varies based on whether the input includes video. |* For 480p and 720p outputs:\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input without video: (Original) 3.5 `Time limited 60% off`\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E   * Input with video: (Original) 2.1 `Time limited 60% off` |Not supported yet |\n|seedance\\-1\\-5\\-pro\\-251215\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Pricing varies based on whether the output includes audio |* Video with audio: 2.4\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* Video without audio: 1.2 |* Video with audio: 1.2\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* Video without audio: 0.6 |\n|seedance\\-1\\-0\\-pro\\-250528 |2.5 |1.25 |\n|seedance\\-1\\-0\\-pro\\-fast\\-251015 |1 |0.5 |\n\n\n\n\u003E * You are only charged for successfully generated videos. No fee is charged if generation fails due to reasons such as content moderation.\n\n\u003E * Estimated video price: `Token unit price × Token consumption`\n\n\u003E * Estimated token consumption = `(Input video duration + Output video duration) × Output video width × Output video height × Output video frame rate \u002F 1024`. This calculation is an estimate. The actual token consumption is subject to the `usage.completion_tokens` parameter returned after the API call.\n\n\u003E * [Dreamina Seedance 2.5 Draft mode](https:\u002F\u002Fai.byteplus.com\u002Fark\u002Fregion:ap-southeast-1\u002Fdocs\u002FModelArk\u002F2607688#2.5_draft_mode) includes two task steps. Each task is billed independently:\n\n\u003E    * Step 1: Generate a Draft video. This step is billed as a 480p video.\n\n\u003E    * Step 2: Generate the final video from the Draft video. This step is billed based on the target resolution:\n\n\u003E       * The token rate is **determined by whether Step 1 includes input video**.\n\n\u003E       * When calculating token consumption, **the input video duration is calculated based on the input video in Step 1. The Draft video is not counted**.\n\n\u003E * Seedance 1.5 Pro: `Draft video token consumption = Estimated normal video token consumption × Conversion factor`. The conversion factor is 0.7 for silent videos and 0.6 for videos with audio.\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"0c3cd17c\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n## Price examples\n\nThe following are some estimated prices based on estimated token usage. You can get a general idea of video generation costs for different specifications.\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"tip\" data-tips-is-title=\"true\"\u003EMinimum token consumption limits\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"tip\"\u003EFor the Seedance 2.0 series and Seedance 2.5 models, when the input includes video, minimum token consumption limits apply:\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"tip\"\u003EIf the estimated token consumption is less than the minimum token consumption, the video price is calculated based on the minimum token consumption.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"tip\"\u003EThe minimum token consumption is related to resolution, aspect ratio, and video output duration. You can check the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fbytedance.larkoffice.com\u002Fwiki\u002FH0fUwHPxtiHayOk6CVpcZzKqnHJ?table=tblnV1KjhYJO12Zh&view=vewWPcN5zJ\"\u003ESeedance 2.0 series minimum token consumption table (estimated)\u003C\u002Fa\u003E and \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fbytedance.larkoffice.com\u002Fwiki\u002FH0fUwHPxtiHayOk6CVpcZzKqnHJ?table=tblTUnmKaxBSqpU7&view=vewpCgsiHf\"\u003ESeedance 2.5 minimum token consumption table (estimated)\u003C\u002Fa\u003E, or use the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fbytedance.larkoffice.com\u002Fshare\u002Fbase\u002Fform\u002FshrcnIHSU1yg0GtzCX4pyW3g3yb\"\u003ESeedance 2.0 Series Pricing Calculator\u003C\u002Fa\u003E or \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fbytedance.larkoffice.com\u002Fshare\u002Fbase\u002Fform\u002FshrcnIYBa28VajWRTpAPEwR4icf\"\u003ESeedance 2.5 Series Pricing Calculator\u003C\u002Fa\u003E to estimate the minimum token consumption for your video generation tasks. The actual token consumption is subject to the \u003Ccode\u003Eusage.completion_tokens\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E field returned after the API call.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"sd25_price\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n### Dreamina Seedance 2.5\n\n\n* **Input without video**\n\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"1.5,1.5,2,2\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Resolution** |**Aspect ratio** |**Output video duration**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(seconds) |**Dreamina Seedance 2.5 price**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n|480p |16:9 |5 |* 0.514 per video\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* 0.103 per second |\n|720p |16:9 |5 |* 1.156 per video\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* 0.231 per second |\n|1080p |16:9 |5 |* 2.843 per video\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* 0.569 per second |\n\n\n\n* **Input with video**\n\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"2,2,3,3,4\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Resolution** |**Aspect ratio** |**Input video duration**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(seconds) |**Output video duration**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(seconds) |**Dreamina Seedance 2.5 price**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E(USD per video) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|480p |16:9 |2\\-30 |5 |0.553\\-2.152\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Lowest price corresponds to 2\\-4 seconds input\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Highest price corresponds to 30 seconds input |\n|720p |16:9 |2\\-30 |5 |1.244\\-4.838\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Lowest price corresponds to 2\\-4 seconds input\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Highest price corresponds to 30 seconds input |\n|1080p |16:9 |2\\-30 |5 |3.062\\-11.907\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Lowest price corresponds to 2\\-4 seconds input\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Highest price corresponds to 30 seconds input |\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"fce02465\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n### Dreamina Seedance 2.0 series\n\n\n* **Input without video**\n\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"3,1,1,1,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Resolution** |**480p** |**720p** |**1080p** |**4K** |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|Aspect ratio |16:9 |16:9 |16:9 |16:9 |\n|Output video duration (seconds) |5 |5 |5 |5 |\n|Dreamina Seedance 2.0 (USD) |* 0.35 per video\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* 0.07 per second |* 0.76 per video\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* 0.15 per second |* 1.87 per video\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* 0.37 per second |* 3.89 per video\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* 0.78 per second |\n|Dreamina Seedance 2.0 Fast (USD) |* 0.28 per video\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* 0.06 per second |* 0.60 per video\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* 0.12 per second |Not supported |Not supported |\n|Dreamina Seedance 2.0 Mini (USD) |* 0.18 per video\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* 0.04 per second |* 0.38 per video\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* 0.08 per second |Not supported |Not supported |\n\n\n\n* **Input with video**\n\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"1,1,1,1,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Resolution** |**480p** |**720p** |**1080p** |**4K** |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|Aspect ratio |16:9 |16:9 |16:9 |16:9 |\n|Input video duration (seconds) |2\\-15 |2\\-15 |2\\-15 |2\\-15 |\n|Output video duration (seconds) |5 |5 |5 |5 |\n|Dreamina Seedance 2.0 (USD per video) |0.39\\-0.86\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Lowest price corresponds to 2–4 seconds input, highest price corresponds to 15 seconds input |0.84\\-1.86\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Lowest price corresponds to 2–4 seconds input, highest price corresponds to 15 seconds input |2.06\\-4.57\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Lowest price corresponds to 2–4 seconds input, highest price corresponds to 15 seconds input |4.20\\-9.33\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Lowest price corresponds to 2–4 seconds input, highest price corresponds to 15 seconds input |\n|Dreamina Seedance 2.0 Fast (USD per video) |0.30\\-0.66\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Lowest price corresponds to 2–4 seconds input, highest price corresponds to 15 seconds input |0.64\\-1.43\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Lowest price corresponds to 2–4 seconds input, highest price corresponds to 15 seconds input |Not supported |Not supported |\n|Dreamina Seedance 2.0 Mini (USD per video) |0.19\\-0.42\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Lowest price corresponds to 2–4 seconds input, highest price corresponds to 15 seconds input |0.41\\-0.91\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Lowest price corresponds to 2–4 seconds input, highest price corresponds to 15 seconds input |Not supported |Not supported |\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"2902b370\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n### Seedance 1.5 Pro\n\nTo get more estimated prices, use the [Price Calculator - SD 1.5 Pro](https:\u002F\u002Fbytedance.larkoffice.com\u002Fshare\u002Fbase\u002Fform\u002FshrcneEuTYlLCqxyCR9IXElPVnc).\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"2,2,2,3,3,3,3\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Resolution** |**Aspect ratio** |**Duration**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(seconds)**  |**Audio video**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(USD per video)**  |**Draft audio video**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(USD per video)**  |**Silent video**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(USD per video)**  |**Draft silent video**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(USD per video)**  |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|480p |16:9 |5 |0.12 |0.07 |0.06 |0.04 |\n|720p |16:9 |5 |0.26 |Not supported |0.13 |Not supported |\n|1080p |16:9 |5 |0.58 |Not supported |0.29 |Not supported |\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"08910d8b\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n### Seedance 1.0 Pro\n\nTo get more estimated prices, please use the [Price Calculator - SD 1.0 Pro](https:\u002F\u002Fbytedance.larkoffice.com\u002Fshare\u002Fbase\u002Fform\u002Fshrcna8QRuYvU0vVl1YrRxfrkvg).\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"1,1,2,1,1,1,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Resolution** |**Ratio** |**Long Side × Short Side (px)**  |**Frame Rate**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(frame\u002Fs)**  |**Duration**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(second)**  |**Usage**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(token)**  |**Price**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(USD)**  |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|480p |16:9 |864×480 |24 |5 |48600 |0.12 |\n||16:9 |864×480 |24 |10 |97000 |0.24 |\n||4:3 |736×544 |24 |5 |46920 |0.12 |\n||4:3 |736×544 |24 |10 |93840 |0.23 |\n||1:1 |640×640 |24 |5 |48000 |0.12 |\n||1:1 |640×640 |24 |10 |96000 |0.24 |\n||21:9 |960×416 |24 |5 |46800 |0.12 |\n||21:9 |960×416 |24 |10 |93600 |0.23 |\n|720p |16:9 |1248×704 |24 |5 |102960 |0.26 |\n||16:9 |1248×704 |24 |10 |205920 |0.51 |\n||4:3 |1120×832 |24 |5 |109200 |0.27 |\n||4:3 |1120×832 |24 |10 |218400 |0.55 |\n||1:1 |960×960 |24 |5 |108000 |0.27 |\n||1:1 |960×960 |24 |10 |216000 |0.54 |\n||21:9 |1504×640 |24 |5 |112800 |0.28 |\n||21:9 |1504×640 |24 |10 |225600 |0.56 |\n|1080p |16:9 |1920×1088 |24 |5 |244800 |0.61 |\n||16:9 |1920×1088 |24 |10 |489600 |1.22 |\n||4:3 |1664×1248 |24 |5 |243360 |0.61 |\n||4:3 |1664×1248 |24 |10 |486720 |1.22 |\n||1:1 |1440×1440 |24 |5 |243000 |0.61 |\n||1:1 |1440×1440 |24 |10 |486000 |1.22 |\n||21:9 |2176×928 |24 |5 |236640 |0.59 |\n||21:9 |2176×928 |24 |10 |473280 |1.18 |\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"cfc5822b\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n### Seedance 1.0 Pro Fast\n\nTo get more estimated prices, please use the [Price Calculator - SD 1.0 Pro](https:\u002F\u002Fbytedance.larkoffice.com\u002Fshare\u002Fbase\u002Fform\u002Fshrcna8QRuYvU0vVl1YrRxfrkvg).\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"1,1,2,1,1,1,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Resolution** |**Ratio** |**Long Side × Short Side (px)**  |**Frame Rate**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(frame\u002Fs)**  |**Duration**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(second)**  |**Usage**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(token)**  |**Price**\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E **(USD)**  |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|480p |16:9 |864×480 |24 |5 |48600 |0.05 |\n||16:9 |864×480 |24 |10 |97000 |0.10 |\n||4:3 |736×544 |24 |5 |46920 |0.05 |\n||4:3 |736×544 |24 |10 |93840 |0.09 |\n||1:1 |640×640 |24 |5 |48000 |0.05 |\n||1:1 |640×640 |24 |10 |96000 |0.10 |\n||21:9 |960×416 |24 |5 |46800 |0.05 |\n||21:9 |960×416 |24 |10 |93600 |0.09 |\n|720p |16:9 |1248×704 |24 |5 |102960 |0.10 |\n||16:9 |1248×704 |24 |10 |205920 |0.21 |\n||4:3 |1120×832 |24 |5 |109200 |0.11 |\n||4:3 |1120×832 |24 |10 |218400 |0.22 |\n||1:1 |960×960 |24 |5 |108000 |0.11 |\n||1:1 |960×960 |24 |10 |216000 |0.22 |\n||21:9 |1504×640 |24 |5 |112800 |0.11 |\n||21:9 |1504×640 |24 |10 |225600 |0.23 |\n|1080p |16:9 |1920×1088 |24 |5 |244800 |0.24 |\n||16:9 |1920×1088 |24 |10 |489600 |0.49 |\n||4:3 |1664×1248 |24 |5 |243360 |0.24 |\n||4:3 |1664×1248 |24 |10 |486720 |0.49 |\n||1:1 |1440×1440 |24 |5 |243000 |0.24 |\n||1:1 |1440×1440 |24 |10 |486000 |0.49 |\n||21:9 |2176×928 |24 |5 |236640 |0.24 |\n||21:9 |2176×928 |24 |10 |473280 |0.47 |\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"c02be6ee\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n# Image generation models\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"2,2,2\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Model ID** |**Input image price (USD \u002F image)**  |**Output image price (USD \u002F image)**  |\n|---|---|---|\n|dola\\-seedream\\-5\\-0\\-pro\\-260628\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E Pricing varies by image generation scenario. |* First image: Free\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* From the 2nd image: 0.003 |**Single image generation:** \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* ≤ 2.61 million pixels (1.5K or lower): 0.045\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* \\\u003E 2.61 million pixels (higher than 1.5K): 0.09\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E**Layer decomposition:** \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* ≤ 2.61 million pixels (1.5K or lower): 0.0225\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* \\\u003E 2.61 million pixels (higher than 1.5K): 0.045 |\n|dola\\-seedream\\-5\\-0\\-flash\\-260915 |Free |0.018 |\n|seedream\\-5\\-0\\-lite\\-260128 |Free |0.035 |\n|seedream\\-4\\-5\\-251128 |Free |0.04 |\n|seedream\\-4\\-0\\-250828 |Free |0.03 |\n|seededit\\-3\\-0\\-i2i\\-250628 |Free |0.03 |\n\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\" data-tips-is-title=\"true\"\u003ENote\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003EImages that are not successfully output due to reasons such as content moderation are not billed.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003EIn Seedream 5.0 pro layer decomposition, layers returned by the same request may fall into different pixel tiers. Each layer is billed separately based on its actual pixel tier.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n* \u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"warning\"\u003EFor Seedream 5.0 lite, Seedream 4.5, and Seedream 4.0, sequential image generation is billed based on the actual number of generated images.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"33538fff\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n# 3D generation models\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"1,2,2\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Model** |**Generation Mode** |**Price (USD \u002F Call)**  |\n|---|---|---|\n|Hyper3d\\-Gen2 |* White model\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* Textured model\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* PBR material model\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* Textured model with PBR materials |0.399\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E `30k tokens \u002F call` \\* `0.0133 USD\u002FK tokens` |\n|Hitem3d\\-2.0 |Standard White Model |0.8\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E `40k tokens \u002F call` \\* `0.020 USD\u002FK tokens` |\n||Standard Textured Model |1.4\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E `70k tokens \u002F call` \\* `0.020 USD\u002FK tokens` |\n||High\\-Precision White Model |1.2\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E `60k tokens \u002F call` \\* `0.020 USD\u002FK tokens` |\n||High\\-Precision Textured Model |1.8\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003E `90k tokens \u002F call` \\* `0.020 USD\u002FK tokens` |\n\n\n\u003E Billing is based on the number of successfully output 3D files.\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"34ca905e\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n# Embedding vision models\n\n\u003E Input (including images) is converted into tokens for billing.\n\n\u003E Pay\\-as\\-you\\-go pricing by token\n\n\n```Plaintext\nInference Cost = \n    text input unit price × text token + \n    image input unit price × image input token\n```\n\n\n\u003E Image tokens = (width px × height px)\u002F784. Maximum token consumption per image is 1312 tokens.\n\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"1,1,1,1.5,1,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Model provider** |**Model** |**Service type** |**Unit price (USD \u002F M tokens)**  |**Billing method** |**Free quota** |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|BytePlus |skylark\\-embedding\\-vision |Inference input (image) |0.325 |Postpaid |500K tokens |\n|||Inference input (text) |0.125 |Postpaid ||\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"a4bfac4b\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n# Model unit\n\nModel units are billed based on the selected machine type and usage duration, and pricing is independent of the model itself. You can flexibly combine **Postpaid (hourly)**  and **Prepaid (monthly)**  billing options.\n\nThe platform also provides a [Model Unit Calculator](https:\u002F\u002Fai.byteplus.com\u002Fark\u002Fregion:ap-southeast-1\u002Fendpoint\u002Fcreate) (available on the order page after login) to help you estimate the required machine types and quantities. It is strongly recommended to perform stress testing with real business traffic to accurately determine the appropriate machine specifications and capacity.\n\nFor more information about how to choose a plan, see [What are the differences between model units of different machine types? How to choose a machine type?](https:\u002F\u002Fai.byteplus.com\u002Fark\u002Fregion:ap-southeast-1\u002Fdocs\u002FModelArk\u002F1359411#112a7e97)\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"tip\" data-tips-is-title=\"true\"\u003ETip\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cdiv data-tips=\"true\" data-tips-type=\"tip\"\u003EThis is a Beta capability only open to invited users. To use it, submit \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fconsole.byteplus.com\u002Fworkorder\u002Fcreate?step=2&SubProductID=P00001514\"\u003Ea test application ticket\u003C\u002Fa\u003E.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"1,1,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Machine type** |**Billing method** |**Pricing (USD\u002FUnit)**  |\n|---|---|---|\n|Flavor\\-A |Postpaid (hourly) |4.20 |\n||Prepaid (monthly) |2800.00 |\n|Flavor\\-C |Postpaid (hourly) |1.80 |\n||Prepaid (monthly) |1300.00 |\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"ma_billing\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n# Managed Agents\n\nBilling is calculated as the sum of three items: Tokens actually consumed during agent operation, agent runtime duration, and number of tool calls.\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"2,4,4,3\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|Billing items |Meaning |Billing rules |Unit price |\n|---|---|---|---|\n|Model invocation |Fees incurred by the agent invoking the model. |Postpaid based on token usage, unit price is subject to the actually invoked model; only standard online inference is supported; billing is generated hourly. |See [Online inference (standard)](https:\u002F\u002Fai.byteplus.com\u002Fark\u002Fregion:ap-southeast-1\u002Fdocs\u002FModelArk\u002F1544106#aa1874cf) |\n|Agent runtime |The cloud\\-isolated sandbox of the agent, used to execute code, read and write files, and run command line tools within a session, and is automatically reclaimed after the session ends. |Billing only applies when the session status is `running`; no billing applies when the status is `idle` (waiting for the user's next message or tool confirmation), `rescheduling`, or `terminated`; runtime is accurate to the second, and billing is generated hourly. |0.08 USD\u002FHour |\n|Tool calling |Fees incurred by the agent invoking tools. Currently supported tools include `web_search` (real\\-time internet search, returns web page titles, abstracts and links) and `web_fetch` (web content crawling, returns body Markdown or refined text). |Billed based on the actual number of invocations by the agent, with billing generated hourly. |* web_search: 0.006 USD\u002FRequest\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E* web_fetch: Free for a limited time |\n\n\n\u003E Billing formula: `Managed Agents fee = Model invocation fee + agent runtime fee + tool calling fee`\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"2a2a6acd\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n# Rate limits\n\nThe call limits for each model are requests per minute (RPM) and tokens per minute (TPM). You can go to the [Model activation](https:\u002F\u002Fai.byteplus.com\u002Fark\u002Fregion:ap-southeast-1\u002FopenManagement) page to view the limits of each account (along with all its sub\\-accounts).\n\nTo increase your limits, submit a request on the console.\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"a05784b7\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n# Service unavailability\n\n\n* An account is considered in arrears when its balance becomes insufficient or falls below zero.\n\n* If an account stays in arrears for 2 hours, the model services will be suspended. Services will resume once the account has been recharged. Please make sure that all outstanding bills are paid on time to avoid any unexpected service interruption.\n\n\n\u003Cspan id=\"a0b6643a\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n# Coding Plan\n\n\n\u003Cspan aceTableMode=\"list\" aceTableWidth=\"1,1,1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n|**Plan** |**Subscription duration** |**Price** |\n|---|---|---|\n|Lite |1 month |10 USD |\n||3 months |30 USD |\n|Pro |1 month |50 USD |\n||3 months |150 USD |\n\n\n\u003E For plan information and special offers, see [Subscription overview](https:\u002F\u002Fai.byteplus.com\u002Fark\u002Fregion:ap-southeast-1\u002Fdocs\u002FModelArk\u002F1925114).\n\n\n\n\n","SeoConfig":{"Title":"","Description":"","Keywords":"ModelArk"},"PDFURL":"https:\u002F\u002Feps-common-private-johor.dualstack.ap-southeast-1.tos.bytepluses.com\u002Fcloud-doc\u002Feps-doc-center-pdf\u002FModelArk_Pricing_1790573506.pdf","CanonicalURL":"\u002Fdocs\u002Fmodelark\u002Fdoc\u002Fmodel-pricing"},"nodeMap":null,"docListMap":null,"feedbackShow":false,"feedbackType":"unknow","feedbackContent":""}},"errors":null}</script><script defer="defer" src="//sf-bpcms.bytepluscdn.com/obj/byteplus-public-aiso/common-lib/static/js/index.1.0.0.4.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/lib-polyfill.f0944611.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/lib-arco.7da0ef0d.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/lib-axios.207ed7bd.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/lib-router.670aa775.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/146.c2df4d2e.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script defer="defer" src="//res.gcloudcache.com/bp-fe/byteplus-doccenter/static/js/main.15e69940.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script>!function(e){var r="function"==typeof window.slardarPluginImageReport?window.slardarPluginImageReport({debug:!1,sample_rate:1}):void 0;window.Slardar("init",{bid:e.bid,env:e.env,release:e.release,integrations:r?[r]:void 0,plugins:{blankScreen:{threshold:1,screenshot:!0,rootSelector:"#root"},ajax:{ignoreUrls:["mcs.snssdk.com","localhost"]},jsError:{ignoreErrors:["ResizeObserver loop limit exceeded"]},pageview:{extractPid:e.extractPid}}}),window.Slardar("start"),window.Slardar("sendEvent",{name:"ssr_level",categories:{site:"www",level:String((window._SSR_DATA||{}).renderLevel)}})}({bid:"byteplus_website",env:"production",release:"1.0.0.758"})</script></body></html>